{"id":"n66638-1-6","stage":1,"title":"빨래 · 洗衣","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66638-1-6-1","ko":"너 제대로 빨래를 한 거 맞아? 때가 하나도 안 빠졌잖아.","zh":"你真的把衣服洗干净了吗？上面一点污渍都没掉啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"제대로","meaning":"好好地、充分地（清洗）","explanation":"제대로：好好地、充分地（清洗）。","readings":[{"term":"제대로","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70896","senseId":"1","lemma":"제대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제대로","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3"}},{"text":"빨래를","meaning":"洗衣，洗衣服","explanation":"빨래：洗衣，洗衣服；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"빨래","audio":"/audio/811f604d9f69b6be72e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66638","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨래를","audio":"/audio/4700747c7baea59165eb.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"맞아?","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아","audio":"/audio/c92874385c2bbee2ea2e.mp3"}},{"text":"때가","meaning":"垢，污垢","explanation":"때：垢，污垢；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14423","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때가","audio":"/audio/2794e832ef37e0b9c41c.mp3"}},{"text":"하나도","meaning":"完全","explanation":"하나：完全；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20283","senseId":"4","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나도","audio":"/audio/11c4172e3e9554b54380.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"빠졌잖아.","meaning":"掉，去，去除","explanation":"빠지다：掉，去，去除；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"빠지다","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66637","senseId":"5","lemma":"빠지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빠졌잖아","audio":"/audio/b83ac06191c008be5a29.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"085882b8f444c8cf","term":"제대로","zh":"好好地、充分地（清洗）","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3","entryId":"70896","definition":"好好地、充分地（清洗）","pronunciation":["제대로"]},{"id":"811f604d9f69b6be","term":"빨래","zh":"洗衣，洗衣服","audio":"/audio/811f604d9f69b6be72e0.mp3","entryId":"66638","definition":"将脏衣服或布等在水中清洗。","pronunciation":["빨래"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"垢，污垢","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"14423","definition":"沾在衣服或身上的脏灰尘，或皮肤废旧细胞和灰尘混合产生的东西。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"完全","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20283","definition":"全然，毫无。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"f1cb0821aeeaddd3","term":"빠지다","zh":"掉，去，去除","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3","entryId":"66637","definition":"染上或沾上的东西被洗掉除净。","pronunciation":["빠ː지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f78aceca41eb71e83288.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66638-1-6-2","ko":"분명히 세탁기에 넣고 제대로 돌렸는데.","zh":"我明明已经把衣服放进洗衣机并正常洗过了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"분명히","meaning":"肯定地，分明地，明明白白地","explanation":"분명히：肯定地，分明地，明明白白地。","readings":[{"term":"분명히","audio":"/audio/5886d7564ad76ada0d96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71047","senseId":"3","lemma":"분명히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분명히","audio":"/audio/5886d7564ad76ada0d96.mp3"}},{"text":"세탁기에","meaning":"洗衣机","explanation":"세탁기：洗衣机；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"세탁기","audio":"/audio/28dea2588945305d6671.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77632","senseId":"1","lemma":"세탁기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세탁기에","audio":"/audio/738ce2426cc48dfa14f7.mp3"}},{"text":"넣고","meaning":"放进，装进","explanation":"넣다：放进，装进；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣고","audio":"/audio/bc9dd322908f47e194c3.mp3"}},{"text":"제대로","meaning":"好好地、充分地（清洗）","explanation":"제대로：好好地、充分地（清洗）。","readings":[{"term":"제대로","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70896","senseId":"1","lemma":"제대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제대로","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3"}},{"text":"돌렸는데.","meaning":"运转，开动","explanation":"돌리다：运转，开动；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"돌리다","audio":"/audio/6d22f9fa2b8915ddd6fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71457","senseId":"2","lemma":"돌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌렸는데","audio":"/audio/9bd9bf7bcfab3b3e0728.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5886d7564ad76ada","term":"분명히","zh":"肯定地，分明地，明明白白地","audio":"/audio/5886d7564ad76ada0d96.mp3","entryId":"71047","definition":"事实准确无误地。","pronunciation":["분명히"]},{"id":"28dea2588945305d","term":"세탁기","zh":"洗衣机","audio":"/audio/28dea2588945305d6671.mp3","entryId":"77632","definition":"用来洗涤衣物的机器。","pronunciation":["세ː탁끼"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放进，装进","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使进入某个空间里。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"085882b8f444c8cf","term":"제대로","zh":"好好地、充分地（清洗）","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3","entryId":"70896","definition":"好好地、充分地（清洗）","pronunciation":["제대로"]},{"id":"6d22f9fa2b8915dd","term":"돌리다","zh":"运转，开动","audio":"/audio/6d22f9fa2b8915ddd6fa.mp3","entryId":"71457","definition":"使某物发挥本能。","pronunciation":["돌리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b539832719dcac0631bb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.817,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66638","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":53,"seq